    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 12.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif man ænig lic of rihtscriftscire elles hwar lecge, gelæste man sawlsceat swa ðeah into ðam mynstre þe hit to hirde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if any body is buried elsewhere than in the parish to which it properly belongs, the payment shall nevertheless be made to the church to which the deceased belonged.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf man ænig lic of rihtscriftscire elles hwar lecge, gelæste man saulsceat swa þeh into þam mynstre, þe hit to hyrde.</ab>
      </div>
